§ `Section 85: references to operation of section 7`

DECLARE `s 85 notice` IS ONE OF
    `s 85 a notice under section 82`
    `s 85 a notice under section 83`
    `s 85 a notice under section 84`

-- "respectively": a notice under s 82 states circumstances of (a), under s 83 of (b), under s 84 of (c). "include": an open list.
-- src:10041 | 85. The circumstances required to be stated in the notice under
-- src:10042 | section 82, 83 or 84 include circumstances by reason of which, having
-- src:10043 | regard to section 7 —
-- src:10045 | (a) a person has an interest in voting shares;
-- src:10047 | (b) a change has occurred in an interest in voting shares; or
-- src:10049 | (c) a person has ceased to be a substantial shareholder in a
-- src:10050 | company,
-- src:10052 | respectively.
@ref s 85 (src:10041-10052)
GIVEN notice IS A `s 85 notice`
      `the circumstance is one by reason of which, having regard to section 7, a person has an interest in voting shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the circumstance is one by reason of which, having regard to section 7, a change has occurred in an interest in voting shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the circumstance is one by reason of which, having regard to section 7, a person has ceased to be a substantial shareholder in a company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 85 the circumstance is one the notice must state` MEANS
    CONSIDER notice
    WHEN `s 85 a notice under section 82` THEN (IF `the circumstance is one by reason of which, having regard to section 7, a person has an interest in voting shares` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "include circumstances by reason of which ..." -- an open list
    WHEN `s 85 a notice under section 83` THEN (IF `the circumstance is one by reason of which, having regard to section 7, a change has occurred in an interest in voting shares` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "include circumstances by reason of which ..." -- an open list
    WHEN `s 85 a notice under section 84` THEN (IF `the circumstance is one by reason of which, having regard to section 7, a person has ceased to be a substantial shareholder in a company` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING)   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "include circumstances by reason of which ..." -- an open list

