-- s 86(3): "non-resident" means a person not resident in Singapore or a body corporate not incorporated in Singapore.
-- src:10079 | (3) In this section, “non‑resident” means a person who is not
-- src:10080 | resident in Singapore or a body corporate that is not incorporated in
-- src:10081 | Singapore.
