    IF (NOT `the person is resident in Singapore`) OR `the person is a body corporate that is not incorporated in Singapore`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“non-resident” means a person who is not resident in Singapore or a body corporate that is not incorporated in Singapore"

