-- The Registrar "may, on the application of a person who is required to give a notice under this Division, in the Registrar's discretion, extend, or further extend, the time".
-- A function named for a power whose gate (the application) is unmet answers NOTHING (the grant ruling of 2026-11-12, limit 1; fork F-j87-1, split site (ii)).
